Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.37,0:00:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他希望我们继承他的事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救人们 猎杀恶鬼 家族使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things. The family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道真相的 关于萨姆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the truth about Sammy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能预先看到人们的死亡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get premonitions of people about to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 预见死亡？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Death visions? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个恶魔说为我制定了计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon said he had plans for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白这是什么意思么？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have any idea what he meant? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你看着萨姆 行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to watch out for Sammy, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有对你说什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些话我不能对萨姆说 对他我得摆张扑克脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't talk about this to Sammy. Gotta keep my game face on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在边缘 你一直紧绷着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on edge. You're erratic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.79,0:00:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了在打猎的时候 因为那时你只能感到恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for when you're hunting, then you're downright scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是 我并不好受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is I'm not handling it very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法控制情绪 还拒绝我的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tailspinning, man. And you won't let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 你不是想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You're not gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓那东西不在我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I swear, it's not in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 我们都会死在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. We're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他说的是实话 - 他不是原来的他 不再是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he's telling the truth. - He's not him, not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 停下 问她 问医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop. Stop it! Ask her! Ask the doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉他那东西不在我身上 - 我… 真的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not in me! - I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你 不在我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. Don't, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发誓 我发誓 - 我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I swear, I swear. - I got no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在我身上 不在我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not in me. It's not in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续向俄勒冈西- 224行驶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue on OR-224 west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国只有两个叫河格罗夫的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two towns in the U.S. named Rivergrove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是俄勒冈州的那个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you're so sure it's the one in Oregon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙上有幅画 画着火山湖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a picture of Crater Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 还有什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏暗的房间 一些人 还有… 一个人被绑在椅子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a dark room, some people, and a guy tied to a chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我在他身上开了个枪洞？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ventilated him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他体内有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought there was something inside him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？他被附身了么？我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A demon? Was he possessed? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的预见每次都或多或少关系到那个黄眼睛恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your visions are tied to the yellow-eyed demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有梦见黑烟？我们有没有念驱逐咒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there any black smoke? Did we try to exorcise him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你就这么毙了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing. You just plugged him. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我肯定有理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I had a good reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会杀无辜之人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm not gonna waste an innocent man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会的 - 我从没说你会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wouldn't. - Never said you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道将发生什么 但无论如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what it is, but whatever it is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人必然牵连其中 我们去找出那个人 看看会发生什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that guy in the chair is part of it. Let's find him, see what's what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么能为你效劳的？- 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I help you? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.55,0:04:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利·吉本斯 弗兰克·别德 美国警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy Gibbons, Frank Beard. U.S. Marshals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有何贵干？- 我们在找一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this about? - We're looking for someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个年青人 二十岁出头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young man, early 20s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个小伤疤 在头顶这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd have a thin scar right below his hairline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找他做什么？- 没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd he do? - Well, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我们在找另一个人 但他也许能提供点线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for someone else. We think this young man can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没惹什么麻烦 至少目前还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in any trouble or anything. Well, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可能知道他的所在 军士长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe you know who he is, master sergeant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲曾经也在军队待过 他是下士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad was in the Corps. A corporal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪一连？- Echo- 2- 1{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What company? - Echo 21.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我们么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can you help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜安·唐纳有那么个伤疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duane Tanner's got a scar like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我了解他 是个好孩子 洁身自好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know him. Good kid, keeps his nose clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我绝对相信这一点 你知道他住哪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sure he does. Do you know where he lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一家人都住在Aspen路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his family, up Aspen Way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「CROATOAN」？- 正是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Croatoan"? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗阿诺克 失落之地 想起来了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roanoke? Lost colony? Ring a bell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你有在历史课上好好听过么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, did you pay any attention in history class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:06:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 全球的战争枪声 议案如何变成法律{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The shot heard around the world, how bills become laws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的不是学校（教的） 是「校舍摇滚」（教的）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not school. That's Schoolhouse Rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗阿诺克是英国在美洲建立的首个殖民地 在十六世纪后期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roanoke was one of the first English colonies in America, late 1500s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对 对 对 我记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, I do remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个地方只留下了刻在树上的这个词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing they left behind was a single word carved in a tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「CROATOAN」 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Croatoan. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 有很多种猜测 印第安人突袭 瘟疫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I mean, there were theories, Indian raid, disease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有人知道真相 就这么消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows what really happened. They were all just gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 一夜之间就消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, wiped out overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真以为这里会发生这种事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think that's what's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我所预见的都不是好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I saw in my head, it sure wasn't good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这怎么会有这个词呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do you think could do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 诚如我所说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, like I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的预见多少关系到那个黄眼恶魔 所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all your weirdo visions are always tied to the yellow-eyed demon somehow, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找帮手 鲍比·艾伦 也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get help. Bobby, Ellen, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话线断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是我要屠城 就会从切断电话开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was gonna massacre a town, that'd be my first step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找谁？- 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想找 杜安·唐纳 他住这是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for Duane Tanner. He lives here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是我哥哥 - 能和他聊聊吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's my brother. - Can we talk to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他现在不在 - 知道他去哪了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not here right now. - You know where he is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他去罗斯林河边钓鱼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He went on a fishing trip up by Roslyn Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你父母都在吗？- 对 他们在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your parents home? - Yeah, they're inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国警官 我们想找你儿子杜安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}U.S. Marshals, sir. We're looking for your son Duane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 他没犯什么事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? He's not in trouble, is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们只是想问他几个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We just need to ask him a couple routine questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么时候能回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's he due back from his trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不太清楚 - 也许你夫人知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not sure. - Well, maybe your wife knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我不知道 她现在不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't know. She's not here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你儿子说她在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your son said she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说过吗？- 她出去买东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I? - She's getting groceries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果杜安回来 他上哪能找到你们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Duane gets back, there's a number where he can get you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不用麻烦了 我们晚点再过来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, we'll just check in with you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点诡异对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was kind of creepy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欲盖弥彰之嫌 - 我们去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Little too Stepford? - Bigtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:09:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 妈妈 一点都不会疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Mom. It's not gonna hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 放下刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Put it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有人需要救治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, we need a doctor here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐纳夫人 发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Tanner, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她被袭击了 - 李医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's been attacked. - Dr. Lee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.53,0:10:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她带进来 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring her in. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐纳先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Tanner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也遇袭了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he attacked too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 事实上 是他发起的攻击 然后他被子弹射中了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, he did the attacking and then he got himself shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被射中了？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shot? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你是谁？- 美国警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And who are you? - U.S. Marshal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你看徽章的 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd show you my badge, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把他带过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry. Bring him back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你说杰克帮了他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you said Jake helped him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子杰克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son Jake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They beat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我绑起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tied me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:11:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我简直不敢相信 - 帕姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't believe it. - Pam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝弗莉 知道他们为什么那么做吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly, you have any idea why they would act this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们有毒瘾吗？- 当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any history of chemical dependency? - No, of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,前一秒他们还是我的丈夫和儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute, they were my husband and my son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一秒就像着了魔一样性情大变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next, they had the devil in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个人从骨子里变质了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys were whacked out of their gourds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？魔鬼附身于众？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? Multiple demons, mass possession?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那样 受害的人应该有很多 天知道有多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's a possession, there could be more. God knows how many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许人多的马上就能组成国会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be like a frigging Shriner convention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 显然 - 这样消灭一个城市再简单不过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - That's one way to wipe out a town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从内部着手 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it from the inside. - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没看到唐纳口中冒黑烟 也没有其他异常现象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't see any demon smoke or any of the other usual signs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不确定 但显然有东西把他们变成那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever. Something turned him into a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道么如果你当时把另一个解决了 我们现在就少一个隐患{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd taken out the other one, there'd be one less to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:11:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 好吗我 当时犹豫了 迪恩 他还是个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, all right? I hesitated, Dean. It was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 「它」不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was an it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是心慈手软的时候 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the best time for a bleeding heart, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 病人怎么样了？- 糟透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's the patient? - Terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底发生什么了？- 我们也不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell happened? - We don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你们刚射杀了我的邻居 - 我们别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just killed my neighbor. - Didn't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 我去找警长 需要电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but we need the county sheriff. I need the coroner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电话不通 - 我知道 我试过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Phones are down. - I know, I tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我你们车上有无线电 - 是有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me you got a police radio. - We do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但和其他东西一样失灵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it crapped out, like everything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道这到底是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最近的城离这多远？- 大约四十里外的响尾蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How far to the next town? - About 40 miles down to Sidewinder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去那里看能否找到人来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go there and see if I can find some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的拍档会留在这里 保护你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner will stick around, keep you guys safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我们什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来的时候会告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get back to you on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体内淋巴细胞的含量异常高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lymphocyte percentage is pretty high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的机体正在对抗某种病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body was fighting off a viral infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是么？什么样的病毒？- 不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? What kind of virus? - Can't say for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的异常举动有可能是因为感染造成的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think an infection could've made him act like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些病毒会造成痴呆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None that I've ever heard of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但据我所知 尚无能引发暴力行为的病毒存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some can cause dementia, but not that kind of violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我从没见过这种作用结果的血液样本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I've never heard of one that did this to the blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么结果？- 血液里有种奇怪的残留物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did what? - There's this weird residue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 那是硫磺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know better, I'd say it was sulfur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫磺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 抱歉 此路不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Sorry, road's closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对 我看得出 出什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can see that. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 隔离 - 隔离？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quarantine. - Quarantine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里附近有事发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something going around out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁告诉你的？- 警长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who told you that? - County sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在这吗？- 不在 他派我们来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he here? - No. He called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下车 和我们聊聊如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, why don't you get out of the car and we'll talk a little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 作为魔鬼 你的确很帅 但我还没那么容易拜倒 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're a handsome devil, but I don't swing that way, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.39,0:15:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你下车事情会好办很多 不会占用你很多时间的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd sure appreciate it if you got out of the car, just for a quick minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我丈夫和杰克都得病了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying my husband and Jake had a disease?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.18,0:16:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我们要调查的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在袭击过程中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, during the attack, do you remember…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有直接接触到他们的血液吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you have any direct contact with their blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是认为我也感染了病毒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I've got this virus, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝弗莉说实话我不知道该怎么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly, I don't know what to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你允许 我想取些你的血液样本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with your permission, we'll take a blood sample.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 手放在我能看见的地方 - 该死…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hands where I can see them! - Son of a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 大块头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, easy there, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下枪 放下枪 - 你是他们中的一员吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put it down! Down! - Lower it now! You one of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你呢？你可能在说谎 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you? Could be lying. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也是 - 好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So could you. - All right. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以站在这里讨论一整天 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could do this all day, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们在杀死对方以前 都先冷静一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take it easy before we kill each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家都是怎么了？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on with everybody? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的邻居 罗杰斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My neighbor, Mr. Rogers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的邻居是罗杰斯？- 不再有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a neighbor named Mr. Rogers? - Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿着柄短斧冲到我家 我把他放倒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came at me with a hatchet. I put him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是唯一的 所有人都变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not the only one. It's happening to everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要去医生的诊所 那里还有几个正常人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading to doc's place. There's some people left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要离开这里 - 这里无路可逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm getting out. - There's no way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:17:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们封锁了桥 跟我一起走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got the bridge.Come on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不信你 - 好吧 那就待这儿 随你便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't believe you. - Fine, stay here. Be my guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这一程够轻松的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this ought to be a relaxing drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们都感染了怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we all have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我们都疯了呢？- 你要冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if we all go crazy? - You've gotta stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心等待 警官已经去寻求帮助了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we can do is wait. The marshal's bringing help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再等了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I've gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下帕姆 你不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam. No, you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的男友在外面 我得确保他的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boyfriend's out there. I gotta make sure he's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 等一下 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, wait. Wait, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很不安 但是留在这里是最安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're upset, all right? But it's safer if you stay here for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy! Open up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打过电话了么？路被封锁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you guys get to a phone? Roadblock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要单独聊聊 医生在里面 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna have a word. Doc's inside. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面发生什么了 迪恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我好像是「最后一个人」里的查尔顿·赫斯顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I feel like Chuck Heston in The Omega Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,军士是我能找到的唯一的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sarge is the only sane person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白我们在对付什么了么？- 明白了 医生觉得可能是病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we dealing with? You know? - Yeah, doc thinks it's a virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好极了 你呢？- 我想她是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, great. What do you think? - I think she's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.05,0:19:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是么？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且受感染者还企图 通过血液直接接触去感染其他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infected are trying to infect others with blood-to-blood contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 受病毒感染的血液中有硫磺成分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets better. The virus leaves traces of sulfur in the blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恶魔病毒？- 更像是恶魔细菌战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A demonic virus? - Yeah, more like demonic germ warfare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少能解释为什么我会预见这些了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least it explains why I've been having visions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像圣经上写的大瘟疫 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's like a Biblical plague. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得简直对极了 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how right you are, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在爸爸的日记里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been poring through Dad's journal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了关于罗阿诺克·科勒尼的记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found something about the Roanoke colony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有呢 - 爸爸对「CROATOAN」有自己的解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Dad had a theory about Croatoan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得那是某个恶魔的名字 也叫做Daeva或者Reshef{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought it was a demon's name, known as Dever or Reshef.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是疾病和瘟疫之魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon of plague and pestilence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是太好了 为什么选择此时此地？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's terrific. Why here? Why now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是 迪恩 天知道这瘟疫会传多远？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, I mean, who knows how far this thing can spread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里警告人们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here. We gotta warn people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逮住一个 在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got one. In here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？那人的妻子… 她被感染了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? The wife. She's infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得处理这事 不能放任她不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take care of this. We can't leave her in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的邻居们… 会越变越强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My neighbors, they were strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拖延越久 她的力量就越大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer we wait, the stronger she'll get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.11,0:20:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想杀了贝弗莉唐纳？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill Beverly Tanner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 可以治疗吗 某种治疗方法吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, could there be any treatment? Some kind of cure for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.83,0:20:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能治愈吗？- 我甚至不知道那是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you cure it? - I don't even know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她破门而出只是时间问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, it's a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让她在里面待着吧 你不能把她当动物那样射死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave her there. You can't shoot her like an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克 你这是干吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克 是外面那些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark, it's them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我关在这 还想杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They locked me in here. They tried to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们被感染了 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're infected, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 马克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都认识那么久了 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've known me all your life. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定她是其中之一？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure she's one of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 那上面有病毒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Oh, God. Is there any on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事吧？- 你没事的 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I okay? - You're clean. You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.94,0:22:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么还留在这里？拜托了 我们快离开这里吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we staying here? Please, let's just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.36,0:22:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 外面到处都是受感染的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't, those things are everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说对了一件事 我们该想办法出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right about one thing. We can't stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.00,0:23:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回罗德豪斯之类的地方去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out, to the roadhouse or somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉人们即将到来的灾难 - 主意是不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let people know what's coming. - That's a good point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是「活死人之夜」可没那么好结局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night of the Living Dead didn't end pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们也不能留在这里 听着 这里的居民大多都擅用来复枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure we got a choice. Folks up here are good with rifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就凭现在的火力 我们很容易被解决掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with all your hardware, we're easy targets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们有… 炸药什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless you got some explosives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.94,0:23:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以自己做一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could make some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.49,0:23:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 让我进去 让我进去 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Let me in! Let me in, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜安·唐纳先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Duane Tanner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.46,0:23:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 感谢上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.71,0:23:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜安 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duane, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是被我… - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy that I. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有谁在？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else is in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:23:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 等一下 小伙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, whoa, whoa, easy there, chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 给他来个全面检查 好么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, doc, give Duane a good once-over, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.44,0:24:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是什么人？- 这不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Never mind who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.28,0:24:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请吧 医生 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doc? - Yeah, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜安 你去哪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duane, where you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在罗斯林河那里钓鱼 下午才回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on a fishing trip up by Roslyn. I came back this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.87,0:24:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好看到罗杰·麦吉尔从家里被拖出来 被那些我熟识的邻居们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Roger McGill being dragged out of his house by people we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们竟然开始用刀割他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started cutting him with knives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仓皇而逃 然后就一直躲在树林里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran. I've been hiding in the woods ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人见过我父母吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anybody seen my mom and dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.21,0:24:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尴尬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.97,0:24:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在流血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.43,0:24:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那伤口是怎么来的？- 我只顾着逃跑 可能被树枝划到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get that? - I was running. I must've tripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.73,0:24:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他绑起来 那里有绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie him up. There's rope there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下… - 坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait-Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.27,0:24:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 杜安 他是对的 我们得谨防{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Duane. He's right. We gotta be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.32,0:24:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨防？防什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful? About what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.40,0:24:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们的血留到你身上没有？没有 什么意思？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they bleed on you? - No. What the hell-? No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.20,0:24:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 有办法证明吗？通过测试什么的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc? Any way to know for sure? Any test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我反复研究了贝弗莉的血液样本 - 我妈妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've studied Beverly's blood work. - My mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.21,0:25:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒有三小时的潜伏期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took three hours for the virus to incubate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.96,0:25:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫磺要到那时才会出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sulfur didn't appear in the blood until then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 我们没办法确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there'd be no way of knowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在杜安被… 改变以前不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until after Duane turns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.26,0:25:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我有话和你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I gotta talk to you. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.26,0:25:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那张椅子上坐好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit in that chair over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.94,0:25:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我梦里见到的 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my vision, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确实发生了 - 没错 我也看出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's happening. - Yeah, I figured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.11,0:25:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能杀了他 不是现在 我们还不知道他是否被感染了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill him. Not yet. We don't know if he's infected or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那不用怀疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're damn sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.82,0:25:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人不知从哪冒出来的 还那么巧划伤了腿 他全家都被感染了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy shows up out of nowhere. Got a cut, his whole family's infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.32,0:25:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该把他绑起来 等待结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should keep him tied up and wait and see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.57,0:25:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让他挣脱去感染其他人么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what? For him to hulk out? Infect somebody else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.33,0:25:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢了 我不能冒那个险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks, can't take that chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.96,0:25:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不希望 但这份工作就是那么难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not happy about this. It's a tough job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那才是最重要的 - 那对我们有什么好处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the point. - What does it buy us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少良心上能过得去 - 对我来说太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A clear conscience, for one. - Well, it's too late for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.47,0:25:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么了？- 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happened to you? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能杀死一个无辜的人 却对此毫不在意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might kill an innocent man and you don't even care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.26,0:26:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行为不像你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't act like yourself anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.10,0:26:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你就和外面那些人一摸一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're acting like one of those things out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.86,0:26:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.98,0:26:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把该死的门打开 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the damn door. Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要那么做 迪恩 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it, Dean! Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 你不是想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You're not gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.25,0:26:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我发誓 我没被感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I swear, it's not in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 我们都会死在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. We're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.05,0:26:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他说的是实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 他不是原来的他 不再是了 - 停下 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, he's not him, not anymore. Stop, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.26,0:26:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,问她 问医生 我没被感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her. Ask the doctor. It's not in me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.15,0:26:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 真的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.03,0:27:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 不要 不要… 我发誓自己没被感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, please. I swear, it's not in me. It's not in me, I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.95,0:27:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓… 自己没被感染… 不要 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, it's not in me. Don't. Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.04,0:27:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.04,0:27:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.38,0:27:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.57,0:27:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.59,0:28:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过了四小时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been over four hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.10,0:28:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜安的血液没有任何反应 我想他没有被感染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duane's blood is still clean. I don't think he's infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.02,0:28:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题的话 我去把绳子解开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to untie him, if that's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.12,0:28:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我会问你原因的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm gonna ask you why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.12,0:28:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 为什么？为什么没杀他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why? Why didn't you do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.01,0:28:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要更多的酒精{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more alcohol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.18,0:28:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么样 帕姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up, Pam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.89,0:28:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.39,0:28:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都快结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll all be over soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.74,0:29:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.99,0:29:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等这一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for this the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.20,0:29:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等什么？- 和你独处的一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For what? - To get you alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.94,0:29:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的血流到他身上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She bled on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.70,0:29:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被感染了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.63,0:30:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 再检查一下他的血液 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, check his wound again, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.18,0:30:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要她检查干嘛？你亲眼看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she need to examine him for? You saw what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.81,0:30:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的血真的接触到你的伤口了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did her blood actually enter your wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.90,0:30:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然接触到了 - 我们不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course it did. - We don't know for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.11,0:30:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能冒险 你知道我们该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take a chance. You know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也别想朝我弟弟开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody shoots my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他反正不会当你弟弟多久了 那是你自己说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be your brother much longer. You said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.28,0:30:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁也别想射谁 - 你可是曾想射死我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody's shooting. - You were gonna shoot me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.58,0:30:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你不闭上嘴我还会的 - 迪恩他们是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't shut your pie hole, I might. - Dean, they're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.91,0:30:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被感染了 把枪给我 我会自行了断的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm infected. Give me the gun and I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.41,0:30:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 休想 - 我不想变成魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forget it. - I won't become one of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.92,0:30:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 我们还有时间 - 有时间做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've still got some time-For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.25,0:30:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解那是你弟弟 我很抱歉 但我必须尽快解决这事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand he's your brother, I'm sorry. I gotta take care of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.84,0:30:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说最后一遍 如果你敢动一下 死的就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll say this once. Make a move on him, you'll be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.63,0:30:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我吗？我的意思听明白了么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me? I mean, do I make myself clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.98,0:30:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 我们能怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Then what are we supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.44,0:31:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here, that's what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.19,0:31:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开我的车 你们有炸药 车里有武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my car. You got the explosives. There's an arsenal in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.03,0:31:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩也一起走吧 你们有足够的火力应付外面的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two go with him. You got enough firepower to handle anything now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.08,0:31:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.50,0:31:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们走 这是你唯一的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with them. This is your only chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.75,0:31:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可别想那么容易摆脱我 - 不 他是对的 和我们一起走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not gonna get rid of me that easy. - No, he's right, man. Come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.68,0:31:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你是自掘坟墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's your funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 谢谢你的帮助 警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Thanks for everything, marshals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.82,0:31:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 事实上 我们不是警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, actually, we're not really marshals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… 噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.14,0:32:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要是有副牌就好了 或者桌式足球也不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish we had a deck of cards or a foosball table or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.52,0:32:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩不要那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.74,0:32:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我 然后离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my gun and leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.16,0:32:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说最后一次 萨姆 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the last time, Sam, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.76,0:32:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你做的最傻的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the dumbest thing you've ever done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.30,0:32:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不那么认为 还记得在Tampa遇到的那个服务生吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that. Remember that waitress in Tampa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.14,0:33:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我被感染了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.10,0:33:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完了 但是你不必陪我去死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over for me. It doesn't have to be for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.48,0:33:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 真的 你可以继续下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No, you could keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.44,0:33:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我想继续了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I want to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.78,0:33:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.58,0:33:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.29,0:33:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作我真的干累了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of this job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.38,0:33:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种生活…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.01,0:33:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩上的沉重负担 老天 我真的累了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This weight on my shoulders. Man, I'm tired of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.76,0:33:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎样？你就准备那么放弃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? So you're just gonna give up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.26,0:33:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你准备就这么毫不反击地赴死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're just gonna lay down and die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.43,0:33:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 迪恩 我知道因为爸爸的事… - 你错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look Dean, I know the stuff with Dad had-You're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.64,0:33:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.02,0:33:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 有一部分 但… - 那么是因为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, part of it is, sure… - Then what is it about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.29,0:34:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好出来看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better come see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.81,0:34:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都不见了 无影无踪 他们全部都消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one. Not anywhere. They've all just vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经过了五小时了 你的血液没有任何异常现象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been five hours and your blood's still clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 但你好像躲过一劫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand it, but you dodged a bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.51,0:35:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确实接触到了病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.30,0:35:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么会没被感染？- 我不知道 但事实的确没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could I not be infected? - I don't know, but you're just not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以拿你的样本和唐纳的比对一下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, when you compare it with the Tanners' samples…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.89,0:35:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.23,0:35:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.98,0:35:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们血液里的病毒消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their blood. There's no trace of the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.03,0:35:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有硫磺 什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sulfur, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.95,0:35:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,军士和我要离开这里 去南边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, the sarge and I are getting the hell out of here, heading south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.87,0:35:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一起来吧 - 我会去响尾蛇那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should come. - I'd better get over to Sidewinder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.71,0:35:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,找人过来调查 但愿他们相信我的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the authorities up here, if they'll believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.55,0:35:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.30,0:35:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的 没有任何感染迹象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be fine. No signs of infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.28,0:36:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 不要那样看着我 我也毫无头绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, don't look at me. I got no clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.28,0:36:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 今夜我会因此失眠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, I'm gonna lose sleep over this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.79,0:36:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么在此时此地？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why here? Why now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.66,0:36:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都去哪了？难道真的有人间蒸发？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did everybody go? It's not like they just frigging melted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.13,0:36:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我对病毒免疫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why was I immune?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.75,0:36:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对 知道么 好问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You know what? That's a good question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.46,0:36:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始感觉那才是 最需要回答的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm already starting to feel like this is the one that got away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.33,0:36:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能在那边停一下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind pulling over up ahead there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.38,0:36:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.05,0:37:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打个电话 这的电话都不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta make a call. - No phone out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.97,0:37:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it covered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.72,0:37:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.34,0:37:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 结果会令你满意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over. You'll be pleased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.67,0:37:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 不需要再进行其他测试了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think any more tests are necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.05,0:37:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个温彻斯特小子 绝对是免疫的 不出所料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchester boy, definitely immune, as expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.43,0:37:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.89,0:37:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何证据留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.47,0:38:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… Last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.72,0:38:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准备告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna tell me what the hell you were talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.31,0:38:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想说什么吗？- 你什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - What do I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.40,0:38:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么意思？你说你对这份工作感到疲累{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you said you were tired of the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.15,0:38:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那不仅是因为爸爸的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that it wasn't because of Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.19,0:38:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别提了 - 不 决不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forget it. - No, I can't. No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.20,0:38:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我以为我们都会死 你不能抓着那时的话不放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were gonna die. You can't hold that over me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.07,0:38:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要和我装糊涂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't pull that crap with me, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.24,0:38:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有话想说 - 如果我说没有呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're talking. - And what if I don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.41,0:38:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我会一直追问你 直到你说为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I guess I'll just have to keep asking until you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.13,0:39:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 老弟 也许我在想我们应该…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. I just think maybe we ought to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.26,0:39:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去大峡谷看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to the Grand Canyon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.93,0:39:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 没错 我们一直{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.89,0:39:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全国来来回回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all this driving back and forth across country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.65,0:39:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,却从没去过大峡谷 也许我们可以去T。-J。-{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been to the Grand Canyon. Or we could go to TJ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.78,0:39:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者好莱坞… 看看是不是有机会上林赛·罗韩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Hollywood, see if we could bang Lindsay Lohan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.28,0:39:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你纯粹胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not making any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.66,0:39:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想说我们得休息一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think we should take a break from all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.70,0:39:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们要回到这种生活中来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we gotta get stuck with the responsibility?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.16,0:39:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们不能享受下生活？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't we live life a little bit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.08,0:39:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you saying all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 迪恩 你是我哥哥 明白么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, Dean. You're my brother, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.96,0:39:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 无论你肩负着什么责任 让我一起分担 哪怕就一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever weight you're carrying, let me help a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.14,0:39:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能 我答应过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.98,0:40:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.19,0:40:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸在死前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before Dad died…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.82,0:40:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉了我一些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he told me something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.12,0:40:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些关于你的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me something about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.67,0:40:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.59,0:40:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他跟你说什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what did he tell you?{\r}
